    "Title": "Turning GLM-5.3-Flash into a Jev-like decision model",
    "Url": "https://www.privatemode.ai/blog/system-one-from-glm-flash",
    "Description": "We found an approach to get Jev-like properties from standard LLMs like GLM-5.3-Flash.\u003Cp\u003EThe core idea is to craft the input prompt so that the first output token answers the question. This makes it possible to get a decision with a single forward pass.\u003Cp\u003EIn the blog post, we describe the approach in detail for GLM-5.3-Flash and vLLM. We benchmark this setup against Jev and Laya. We find that our setup is on-par with Jev in terms of accuracy and speed and that it substantially outperforms Laya.\u003C",
